      "text": "The assumed premium charge leaves $190 of the $200 payment. Then $1,000 + $190 + $20 − $130 = $1,080. Without that payment, $1,000 + $20 − $130 = $890. Real contracts specify their own deductions, timing, rates and calculation order.",
